          uploading blocks, replace the block/transfer link array with only the links you
          used (same `href` values), then pass the updated document to `asset_finalize_file_upload`.

        **Important:**
        - Call this once per upload intent; repeated calls create separate upload sessions
        - `shorten_block_upload_urls` defaults to true so transfer/finalize URLs stay compact in context; AI agents should leave it true.


